  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the burden of TB in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the national NGO Health Development Program and their work to reduce the burden of tuberculosis in Sudan by creating awareness, finding more people with TB and helping people through treatment and also post TB. The program outcome is that the rights and needs of people affected by TB are met. The project focuses on the rights and needs of men, women and children affected by TB through a gender sensitive and rights based approach. TB and gender analysis are undertaken and actions adjusted according.</narrative>
  </description>
